# Google Maps Embed API Configuration
# 1. Enable "Maps Embed API" in your Google Cloud Console project.
# 2. Restrict this browser API key by HTTP referrers (e.g. http://localhost:*, https://your-domain.com/*).
# 3. Restrict API key usage specifically to "Maps Embed API".
# 4. Copy this file to .env or .env.local and provide your key below:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
